### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### 1. Verify Character by UID and Server (e.g. Sweettoast Lv. 80)
POST {{baseUrl}}/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "server": "4"
}

### 2. Verify Character - Negative Test (Invalid Non-numeric UID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/aniimo/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "ABC999123",
  "server": "4"
}

### 3. List Supported Game Servers
GET {{baseUrl}}/aniimo/servers

### 4. Get Taiwan Region Packages (TWD Currency / MyCard Channel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/aniimo/packages

### 5. Create UID Top-Up Order with MyCard Gateway Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/aniimo/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "412000126173",
  "serverId": "4",
  "packageId": "prod_star_300",
  "payChannel": "mycard_points"
}

### 6. Health Check
GET http://localhost:4000/health
